You can find the documentation for pdnsd in the `doc/txt/` directory.
The following documents are available:

intro.txt		Overview, system requirements
manual.txt		Building, installation and usage instructions
faq.txt			The FAQ

Maintained repository: https://github.com/kenzok8/pdnsd
Current maintained version: 1.3.3

